1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,333
The only surviving
eyewitness letter

2
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:04,600
about the 1621 feast

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,600
never mentions
a turkey.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,267
It describes
fowl, five deer,

5
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:10,967
and three days.

6
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:13,433
In 1841, the historian

7
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:15,767
Alexander Young
added a note:

8
00:00:15,767 --> 00:00:17,167
they no doubt feasted

9
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:19,000
on wild turkey.

10
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,133
The letter itself does

11
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:21,300
not say so.

12
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Full story on Quiet Origins
